Package: mtd
Title: Mixture Transition Distribution Models for Non-Gaussian Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2021-09-02
Author: Xiaotian Zheng <xzheng24@ucsc.edu>
Maintainer: Xiaotian Zheng <xzheng24@ucsc.edu>
Description: Fit univariate non-Gaussian time series using mixture transition
             distribution (MTD) models. The bivariate normal CDF implementation
             is adapted from pbv by Alexander Robitzsch.
